=== A7. Stiefel-Whitney classes of the chimeric bundle (splitting principle, mod 2) ===
  V = Sym^2  : w1 = 1*w1(X); w2 = 1*w1(X)^2 + 0*w2(X)
  H* = T*X   : w1 = 1*w1(X); w2 = 0*w1(X)^2 + 1*w2(X)
  C = V + H* : w1 = 0*w1(X); w2 = 0*w1(X)^2 + 1*w2(X)
